      en: ["Highest point within Panama City (199 meters).", "Returned to Panama under the Torrijos-Carter Treaties.", "The flag at the summit is the size of a basketball court.", "Home to over 39 species of mammals in an urban forest.", "Formerly the site of the Quarry Heights military headquarters.", "Named after the Spanish explorer Pedro de Ancón."],
