      en: ["The official elevation of the summit is 1,185 meters above sea level.", "The Cerro Gaital Natural Monument was established as a protected area in 1995.", "The peak is part of the El Valle volcanic crater, which spans about 6 kilometers in width.", "It serves as a key habitat for the endangered Panamanian Golden Frog.", "Geological estimates place the age of the volcanic rock formations at 300,000 years.", "More than 150 distinct bird species have been recorded within the cloud forest zones."],
