      en: ["The island was designated as a wildlife refuge on June 15, 1981.", "The island's coral reef covers an area of 16 hectares.", "It hosts a colony of approximately 5,000 magnificent frigatebirds.", "The beaches are composed 100% of dead coral limestone.", "Humpback whales use the waters from June to October for calving.", "There are two main trails that open the island to visitors."],
